### 1. 회원 등록1 (일반 유저)
POST http://localhost:3000/member/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "user",
  "pw": "user@pass",
  "name": "일반유저",
  "phone": "010-1234-1234"
}

### 1. 회원 등록2 (관리자)
POST http://localhost:3000/member/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "admin",
  "pw": "admin@pass",
  "name": "관리자",
  "phone": "010-1234-1234",
  "grade": "admin"
}

