}

### 2. 회원 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:3000/member/list

### 3. 회원 상세보기 (아이디 수정: admin2 -> admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/member/get/admin

### 4. 회원 수정
PUT http://localhost:3000/member/update/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "관리자(수정된 이름)",
  "grade": "admin"
}

### 5. 회원 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:3000/member/delete/yeardream